### 获取用户列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getUserList
Content-Type: application/json

### 获取用户详细信息，通过id
#GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getUserId
    #?userId=24209170533


### 获取用户信息，通过名字获取信息
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getUserByName
    ?userName=admin

### 获取头像
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getUserAvatar
    ?userName=admin

### 获取活动名称
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getActivity
    ?activityUrl=1

### 获取活动终止时间戳
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getActivityEndTimeByUrl
    ?activityUrl=1

### 获取活动开展情况
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getActivityActiveByUrl
    ?activityUrl=1

### 获取活动剩余人数
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getActivityRemainsByUrl
    ?activityUrl=1

### 获取用户头像
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getUserAvatar
    ?userName=admin

### 上传/更新用户头像
POST http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/uploadAvatar
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userName": "admin",
    "avatarUrl": "https://example.com/path/to/avatar.jpg"
}

### 获取活动列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getCreatedActivities
    ?userName=admin

###获取参与者信息
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getParticipatedActivities
    ?userName=admin

###获取结果
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getWinningResults
    ?userName=admin

### 获取活动启动时间戳
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/getActivityStartTimeByUrl
    ?activityUrl=1

### 测试抽奖
POST http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/drawLotteryByUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "activityUrl": "1",
    "userName": "admin"
    }

### 测试登录
POST http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userName": "admin",
    "passWord": "123456"
    }

###
GET http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/auth/login
    ?userName=admin


###
POST http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/auth/checkUsername
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "userName": "admin"
    }

### 记录用户参与活动
POST http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/recordParticipation
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "activityUrl": "2",
    "userName": "zhuzhu"
}

### 创建抽奖活动
POST http://127.0.0.1:33001/api/user/createLottery
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "lotteryData": {
        "username": "admin",
        "lotteryInfo": {
            "name": "better-sqlite3测试",
            "description": "测试better-sqlite3配置"
        },
        "prizes": [
            {
                "name": "测试奖品1",
                "quantity": 1,
                "weight": 10
            },
            {
                "name": "测试奖品2",
                "quantity": 2,
                "weight": 20
            }
        ],
        "timeSettings": {
            "startTime": "2023-12-01T00:00:00",
            "endTime": "2023-12-31T23:59:59"
        }
    }
}